' Shared display-list records used by the native printing backends.
' Coordinates, page sizes and font sizes are in points (72 points per inch).
Public Class BuoyPrintText
    Public Property Content As String
    Public Property X As Double
    Public Property Y As Double
    Public Property FontName As String = "sans-serif"
    Public Property FontSize As Double = 12.0
End Class

Public Class BuoyPrintPage
    Public Property Items As Array Of BuoyPrintText = []
End Class

Public Class BuoyPrintDocument
    Public Property PageWidth As Double = 595.275590551
    Public Property PageHeight As Double = 841.88976378
    Public Property Pages As Array Of BuoyPrintPage = []
End Class
